Subject: AutoReelEffect: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTask with native Folia entity scheduler

AE PATCH REASON: SchedulerUtils.runTask crashes on Folia region threads (stripped class throws UnsupportedOperationException); obfuscated var names reduce maintainability.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTask with player.getScheduler().run(EffectsHandler.getInstance(), scheduledTask -> ..., null) so hook retrieval and PlayerFishEvent firing happen on the player's region thread. Rename obfuscated vars.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → EntityScheduler. RF: var rename. No behavior change.

